WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.820
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.140
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.490
It's a Synchro Monster 
in the Blackwing series!

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.060
What's a Wedge Counter?

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.710
For details, watch the episode!

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:32.150
Yusei!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.130
Crow!

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.010
It's been a long time.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.660
You came back!

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:43.080
I came here because I saw a helicopter, 
but I didn't know you were on it!

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.880
And you also have a Marker!

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:46.880
Yeah.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.280
You finally completed your D-Wheel.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:51.580
Yeah.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:57.270
It's very cool!  With this, I'm 
going to beat you and Jack!

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:06.840
It feels great to ride with you 
for the first time in a long time!

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:08.520
Same here.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.680
I see.  You're caught 
in a horrible situation.

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:19.870
I want to make sure that Rally is safe.

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.050
All right, let's go to your hideout.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.950
Crow, there seems to be 
less people than usual.

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:30.770
This mysterious group 
recently arrived.  Look.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.680
It's rumored that they 
trick people with their

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:37.680
shady lectures and gather 
them deep within Satellite.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:39.720
Deep within Satellite?

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:42.910
Even Satellite is becoming weird.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:03.690
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:08.790
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:13.700
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:18.470
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.840
No matter how bad today is

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:28.820
There’s still the faintest light

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:34.220
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:38.290
Is light it myself

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:43.290
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:48.260
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:54.560
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:58.540
Today will never exist again

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:04.440
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:34.930
Hometown and Friends
Reunion Tag Riding!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.100
<i>"Jack Atlas is actually from Satellite!"</i>

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:48.340
I...

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:56.710
Stardust Dragon!

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.860
Roar!  Shooting Sonic!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.900
Impossible...

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:20.290
I, the King, lost again?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:25.370
I knew you would try to defeat me 
using the same strategy as before.

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:29.880
Since you want to be the King, 
you lost against your own pride.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:38.150
While reporters are running around 
the City, what have you been doing?

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:39.960
I have a lot of good reasons why.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:40.940
Carly.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:45.170
If you don't bring me an article 
I can use, you're fired!

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:53.460
If I reveal that I'm actually a reporter and 
would like an interview, he'll probably get mad.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.300
But that's my job!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.960
Excuse me…

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.260
He's not here!

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:24.780
Is that the sound of a D-Wheel?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:25.980
Can it be?

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.450
It's Yusei!

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:37.700
He's back!

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:38.920
What?

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:39.800
Yusei?

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:41.900
I'm happy that everyone's safe.

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:43.550
Yusei!

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:47.770
I knew that you'd come home, Yusei!

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:50.010
Sorry to keep you waiting, Rally.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:53.780
Saiga, thank you.

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:55.190
It's fine.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:59.230
Isn't it about time you 
let me into this group?

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:00.240
Crow!

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:02.930
I'm shocked!  That was you?

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:07.450
Yusei isn't the only D-Wheeler in Satellite.

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:09.550
We found you, Crow!

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.420
This is Security!  Come out nice and quiet!

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:16.320
It seems we brought some unexpected guests.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:22.090
This is bad!  It's tear gas!

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.110
Leave it to me.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.700
Let's meet at Daedalus 
Bridge.  My hideout is there.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.550
Crow, come out nice and quiet!

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.490
You can't escape!

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:39.110
It's him!

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:40.940
We won't let you escape, Crow!

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.570
We'll capture you with our new weapon!

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.460
Interesting!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.080
It seems you have some skills.

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:56.680
Yusei!

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.620
I also feel like playing.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:03.080
That's Yusei Fudo.

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:05.210
He came back to Satellite.

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:07.580
If he's going to interfere, 
then we'll also capture him!

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:09.150
Let's do it!

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:16.460
We force the Field Spell to 
activate!  Speed World set on!

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:19.510
Duel Mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:22.330
Duel Mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:27.810
They're starting a duel 
that uses Tag Force rules.

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:32.270
The rules state that two people share 
a single field and life points.

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:33.200
Interesting!

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:35.650
Yusei, for the first time 
in awhile, let's team up!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.120
Duel!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.940
Where did he go?

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:49.920
What?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.390
Please insert a ticket.

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:52.980
Why can't I pass?

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.800
Isn't that Jack Atlas?

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.210
It can't be.

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:59.100
But he looks just like him.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:01.380
Jack is from Satellite, right?

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:06.960
There's nothing special about this guy!  
He's just a person who looks like Jack!

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:07.890
You…

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:15.310
What are you doing?  Your 
wounds haven't healed yet!

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.790
If you walk around, it's 
going to cause hysteria!

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:22.570
The press is looking for you!

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:25.010
You have no right to order me around.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.120
At this rate, I won't 
be able to get my scoop.

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:31.000
I have to make my stand.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:34.190
I see!  Even though I saved 
you and nursed you back

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:37.190
to health, you don't feel 
the least bit of gratitude!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:42.250
I don't care about anyone who doesn't feel 
gratitude!  You don't even know how to ride a monorail!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.570
Everyone!

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:46.170
You want to hear a shocking fact?

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.060
The former King Jack-

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.860
I'll accompany you for a little while.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:54.950
That went well.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:02.550
Now no one will know it's you!

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:05.530
I'll make you regret putting 
me in this situation!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:10.000
Say whatever you want.  You're the one 
who said that you'll hang out with me.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.430
You…

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:16.750
In order to write the article, I have 
to unearth Jack's deepest emotions.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.500
I know!

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:21.810
What are they doing?

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:25.010
I don't know, but that woman is a reporter.

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:28.680
If they're together, then Master 
Atlas will fall victim to the press.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.320
I go first!

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.980
I summon Gate Blocker in defense position!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:43.460
Those idiots always use the same strategy.

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:48.300
I release Gate Blocker to summon 
Gate Blocker 2 in defense position!

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.610
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:55.370
That's your new strategy?

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:56.570
My turn!

00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:59.090
The Continuous Trap Full Throttle!

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:03.430
With this card, Speed World gives 
me one extra Speed Counter.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:09.190
And due to Gate Blocker 2's monster 
effect, you can't gain Speed Counters!

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:14.330
That means we can't use Speed Spells.

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:18.150
It wouldn't be fun if we 
didn't give you a handicap.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.650
Next is the Continuous trap Speed Edge!

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:22.540
During each Standby Phase, 
you take 300 points of

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:25.540
damage multiplied by the difference 
in our Speed Counters!

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:30.140
Our current speed difference is two.  
Therefore, Crow takes 600 points of damage!

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:34.630
Are you okay, Crow?

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:37.350
That was nothing.  It 
felt less than a massage.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.290
I'll get you back with this!

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.340
I summon Blackwing - Bora the Spear!

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:48.400
Then I use Blackwing's monster effect 
to Special Summon Gale the Whirlwind!

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:55.160
When I have a Blackwing monster on my field, 
I can Special Summon this monster from my hand.

00:10:57.020 --> 00:11:03.210
Once a turn, Gale the Whirlwind cuts your 
monster's attack and defense points in half!

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:06.560
The Continuous Trap Defender's Mind!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:10.170
This doubles the defense points 
of a defending monster!

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:11.880
Too bad, Crow!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:15.390
Not only do they have a strong defense, 
but they also limit our Speed

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:19.390
Counters so that they can use their 
effect to deal damage.  This isn't good.

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:24.320
This is a good time to introduce 
them to the ace of my deck!

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:48.610
Level 3 Gale the Whirlwind 
tunes Level 4 Bora the Spear!

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:55.700
Black wind, turn into wings 
that rise to the heavens!

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:58.670
Synchro Summon!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:02.320
Blackwing Armor Master!

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.700
Go, Black Hurricane!

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:13.210
You fool!  Its attack points are less 
than Gate Blocker 2's defense points!

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.110
You're the one who's going to take damage!

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:23.410
My Blackwing Armor Master can 
make battle damage become 0!

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.210
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:34.940
Gale the Whirlwind's monster effect ends, 
and I add the effect of Defender's Mind!

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:42.810
With 6000 defense points, you'll 
never destroy Gate Blocker 2.

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:44.420
It's my turn.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:49.020
Due to the effects of Full Throttle and Gate 
Blocker 2, the difference in our speed is four.

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:51.210
Take Speed Edge's effect!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:58.210
I summon Gate Defender in defense 
position and end my turn.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:06.050
Once a turn, that monster can 
negate our monster's attack.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:10.360
Yusei, I've hammered in a wedge.  
I leave the rest to you!

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:14.670
Yeah!  Our bond will destroy 
that wall's defense!

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:40.510
All right, all right.

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:42.370
Are you okay, sir?

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:46.750
I can't take much more of this.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:50.310
How much longer do I have 
to hang out with you?

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:56.350
He's completely fine?  And he 
hasn't opened up to me at all!

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:59.750
This should be enough to pay you back.

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:02.940
Please wait!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.300
Enough is enough!

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:07.010
Jack!  It's Jack Atlas!

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:11.240
This man looks like Jack, but it's not him.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.230
I'm Jack's biggest fan!

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:19.240
Everyone says that Jack is a liar, 
but I'm rooting for him forever!

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:29.580
Jack, make sure you become the King again!

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:43.910
Jack…

00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:56.990
Jack!  Jack!  Jack!

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:58.050
Jack.

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:08.500
He's hurting emotionally.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:13.570
And I was going to use his pain to write 
an article.  Am I a horrible person?

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:15.220
Carly!

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:17.270
Angela?

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:21.730
You must've also heard through the 
grapevine that Jack Atlas is here.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.860
What?  Jack?

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:27.160
I have to know if he's from Satellite.

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:30.770
If he was lying, then what 
he did was a huge fraud.

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:34.100
I'm sure he was lying because he ran away.

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:40.080
Jack is hurting because he lost his King 
status!  I won't allow you to ask him about that!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:44.040
What are you talking about?  
It's our job as reporters.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.220
Besides, you said it yourself.

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:50.440
You hate arrogant, pompous people like Jack!

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:55.730
What?

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:56.880
What's wrong?

00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:57.940
You can have these!

00:15:58.530 --> 00:15:59.960
What's with you?

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.390
Where did he go?

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:16.950
That tower…

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.450
You can see it from my apartment.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:23.350
The monorail also goes to that tower.

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.090
My turn!

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.520
Our speed difference is now six!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.760
Speed Edge's effect activates!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:35.720
Hang in there, Yusei!

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:37.820
I summon Turbo Synchron!

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:46.400
I activate my trap Level Retuner!  
Armor Master's Level decreases by two!

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:48.980
He lowered the Level of his own monster?

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:53.550
Level 1 Turbo Synchron 
tunes Level 5 Armor Master!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:59.750
The stars come together to call forth a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.130
Synchro Summon!

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.500
Roar, Turbo Warrior!

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:10.940
He lowered the Level so that 
he could summon that monster!

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:13.940
However, it only has 2500 attack points.

00:17:13.940 --> 00:17:17.400
Furthermore, due to Gate Defender's 
monster effect, you can't attack!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:19.920
Unfortunately for you, Turbo 
Warrior isn't affected

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:22.820
by the monster effects of 
Level 6-or-below monsters.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:25.640
Level 4 Gate Defender's 
monster effect doesn't work!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:28.140
I activate my trap Ebon Arrow!

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:31.380
This card lowers Turbo Warrior's 
attack points by 500.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:33.900
However, if its attack points 
are greater than your defending

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:37.770
monster's defense points, the 
difference is dealt to you as damage.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:42.130
You also take damage equal to the destroyed 
monster's original defense points!

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:44.200
Go, Turbo Warrior!

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:49.750
You fool!  Attacking a monster with 
6000 defense points is suicide!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:52.820
You're the fool!  Look at the defense points!

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:53.540
What?

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.560
0 defense points?

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:56.780
Why?

00:17:56.780 --> 00:18:00.530
When Armor Master attacks a monster, 
it sticks in a Wedge Counter.

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:05.310
On the turn that it's removed, your 
monster's attack and defense points become 0!

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:06.470
What?

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:09.890
Accel Slash!

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:18.970
Now take the damage from Ebon Arrow's effect!

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:28.550
He escaped again.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.500
We did it, Crow!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.150
You've improved your skills 
by going to the City.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:35.030
I guess.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.790
How's Jack doing?

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:42.060
They found out that he's from 
Satellite, so he went into hiding.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:43.490
Jack?

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:46.600
Do you hate him for what 
happened two years ago?

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:48.800
I don't hate him.

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:53.660
It's the path Jack chose for himself.  
No one could've stopped him.

00:18:55.970 --> 00:19:01.250
I believe in him.  No matter how far 
he falls, he always climbs back up.

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:04.300
You're right.  He's that kind of guy.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:05.950
Jack…

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:24.980
If you want to talk to him, 
isn't this the right time?

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:26.860
Jack.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.890
You were planning to come 
here the entire time.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:42.520
You can't see Satellite from here.

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:53.640
Two years ago, I came to 
this city from Satellite.

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:58.980
I threw away my hometown and my friends.

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:05.500
I lost everything and all 
I received in exchange

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:10.500
was the King's path of 
self-delusion and foolishness.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:15.750
I was a stupid duelist who forgot who he was.

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:27.120
Now that I've lost everything, I finally 
realize what truly kept me going.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:34.810
If you know that, then you 
should start your life anew.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:40.010
The old Jack died in his 
battle against Yusei.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:42.950
The real Jack Atlas starts his life now.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:47.620
And try to become a real King.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:53.550
Jack!

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.010
Hey Jack.

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:55.970
Jack.

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:57.030
Jack!

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:58.280
Jack!

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.150
You're right.

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:30.900
I'll no longer be confused.  
I'll travel my own path.

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:32.280
Jack!

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.150
You can write whatever you want about me.

00:21:38.550 --> 00:21:45.570
I've decided that I won't write an article 
that would hurt duelists, including you.

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:51.630
Because I've finally started 
to understand how you feel.

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:55.780
Do whatever you want.

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:01.490
Wait up, Jack!

00:22:13.990 --> 00:22:18.460
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:23.530
We will build our own future

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.970
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:34.150
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:49.290
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:54.860
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:59.570
Even if it loses its light

00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:04.840
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:04.840 --> 00:23:09.310
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:14.890
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:19.750
This journey has no end

00:23:19.990 --> 00:23:25.230
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:30.470
Hear my voice
